                "question": "If I play Urias, Final Vampire's On Evolve ability and choose option 1 when my leader has 1 defense, do I lose the game before this spell gives my leader +1 defense?",
                "answer": "Yes. Confirmation Timing occurs after Urias's On Evolve ability resolves, at which point your leader has 0 defense."
              },
